@startuml
title Passage API: Endpoint Flow

actor Frontend as FE

rectangle "ApiController (GET /api/passages/{id})" as Controller_Get
rectangle "ApiController (POST /api/passages/submit)" as Controller_Post
rectangle "IPassageRepository / PassageRepository" as Repo
rectangle "IGradingService / GradingService" as Service
database "AppDbContext (Passages, Questions)" as DB

FE -> Controller_Get: GET /api/passages/{id}
Controller_Get -> Repo: GetEntityByIdForReviewAsync(id)
Repo -> DB: query Passages + Questions (ordered by Position)
Repo --> Controller_Get: PassageForReviewDto
Controller_Get --> FE: 200 OK + PassageForReviewDto

FE -> Controller_Post: POST /api/passages/submit {PassageId, Answers[]}
Controller_Post -> Service: GradeAsync(PassageSubmissionDto)
Service -> Repo: GetEntityByIdForGradingAsync(PassageId)
Repo -> DB: query Passages + Questions (select minimal fields)
Repo --> Service: PassageForGradingDto
Service -> Service: validate & score
Service --> Controller_Post: SubmissionFeedbackDto
Controller_Post --> FE: 200 OK + SubmissionFeedbackDto

note right of Service
Validation checks:
- duplicates
- unknown question ids
- SelectedAnswer bounds
end note

@enduml
